@startuml Email Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title E-mail — gated, safe delivery

participant "Feature use case" as Caller
participant EmailService as Email
participant GetFeatureFlagsService as Flags
database "MySQL\nFeatureFlagsRepository" as Database
participant UnsubscribeTokenService as Token
participant SmtpService as SMTP

Caller -> Email : send notification with typed data and recipient(s)
Email -> Flags : isSwitchedOn(notification-specific flag)
Flags -> Database : read flag state and target roles
Database --> Flags : feature flag
Flags --> Email : enabled / disabled

alt Disabled, unsubscribed or inactive recipient
  Email --> Caller : skipped result; business operation remains successful
else Eligible delivery
  Email -> Token : create recipient-specific unsubscribe token
  Token --> Email : signed token
  Email -> Email : render shared layout + notification template
  Email -> SMTP : send one or bulk messages
  SMTP --> Email : delivered or provider failure
  Email --> Caller : success/failure result without throwing
end

note over Email, SMTP
  Security/account e-mails may bypass inactive/unsubscribed suppression.
  Every notification type has its own feature flag.
end note
@enduml
